(dict *)		stanislav stan
(heads *)		oboe
(male *)
(musician *)
(* is #partof #oboes)

(descr *)

			Stanislav, second oboe, is a chatty, balding fellow
			with a keen mind and an excellent embouchure. He
			somehow makes a living selling used reeds.

