			Thomas, French horn, is doing a PhD in mathematics, and
			totally looks the part. But when he opens his mouth,
			his deep baritone evinces a background in stage poetry
			and barbershop singing. He likes to hang out at Chez
			(link [anna]) Anna , studying or chatting with his
			friend (link [david]) David , and he recently moved in
			with (link [melody]) Melody .

