(descr *)

			Michael, first trumpet, likes to wear a suit all day,
			every day. Of course, everybody is in full dress
			tonight, but Michael goes the extra mile with golden
			cufflinks and a pocket watch that he keeps checking in
			a meticulously casual manner.
			(select)

				(link [jennifer]) Jennifer says he grew up on a
				pig farm.

			(or)

				He is engaged to be married to (link [lydia])
				Lydia .

