#trumpet2
(name *)		second trumpet
(dict *)		anna twin
(plural dict *)		twins
(heads *)		trumpet
(female *)
(musician *)
(* is #partof #trumpets)

(descr *)

			Anna is the identical twin of (link [eve]) Eve in the
			(#horns), and the sister-in-law of (link [pia]) Pia .

			Charming and outgoing but utterly restless, Anna has
			been doing odd jobs for as long as you've known
			her—everything from cichlid breeding to high rise
			window cleaning. She tried to run a café for a while,
			but it was difficult to make ends meet, and she
			eventually sold it to (link [jeanette]) Jeanette , the
			piccolo player.

