(descr *)

			Ed, second trombone, is still in high school. He hasn't
			been an orchestra musician for more than a few years,
			but he makes steady progress. (link [jacob]) Jacob
			keeps him under his wing.

			(par)

			In the last couple of weeks, Ed has been approaching
			you with all sorts of questions about conducting. But
			he's not planning to follow in your footsteps: It turns
			out that he is playing some kind of music-related
			computer game with (link [david]) David .

