(male *)
(musician *)
(* is #partof #brass)
(slice * 3)

(descr *)

			Peter, bass trombone, has a respectable lung capacity,
			and the frame that goes with it. Reliable, cordial, and
			good-natured. One of his eyes is made of porcelain.

			(par)

			He works at (link [harold]) Harold (no space) 's Garden
			Supplies, and used to be in a book club with (link
			[joy]) Joy and (link [liu yang]) {Liu Yang}.

