				(or)
					Anthony is
				(stopping)
				sound asleep.
				(par)
			(endif)

			Anthony, tuba player and son of (link [conrad]) Conrad
			, has his brown hair tied in a bun. He actually left
			Bournebrook Rill to study engineering, but still comes
			to rehearsals every week. You've got a hunch that he
			sticks around because of (link [melody]) Melody .

			(par)

			(bar $Bar)
			(if) ($Bar < 4) (then)
			(elseif) ($Bar < 22) (then)
				Anthony is looking
				(if) ($Bar < 12) (then)
					(select)
						rather
					(or)
						quite
					(purely at random)
				(else)
					(select)
						very
					(or)
						dangerously
					(or)
						precariously
					(purely at random)
				(endif)
				(select) tired. (or) weary. (purely at random)
				(now) (tuba known to be sleepy)
			(elseif) ($Bar < 25) (then)

				Anthony is enjoying the beautiful music with
				his eyes closed.

			(endif)

