		Beyond is the (#orchestra).
		(par)
	(endif)

(descr *)
	%% Normally, [examine #hall] would invoke (look #hall) since it's the
	%% visibility ceiling. But in this game, we override the default
	%% behaviour of (perform [examine $]).

	This spacious auditorium was built in the seventies, to endorse and
	promote local drama productions and musical performances.

	(descr #interior)

(describe score)

	The (#score {printed score}) lies
	(if) (#score is closed) (then) unopened (endif)
	in front of you, on the (#stand)
	(if) (#baton has parent #stand) (then)
		, next to your (#baton)
	(endif)
	.

(from #hall go #out to #south)

(narrate failing to leave #hall $)
	This is not a good time to leave.

