(perform [wave/push * | $])
	(* has parent #maestro)
	(if) (bar 0) (then)

		If the (#harp2) is startled by your unannounced baton movement,
		she doesn't show it. But you end up beating a full bar in
		silence before she plays the arpeggiated chord that leads up to
		the first bar of the piece.

		(now) (got bearings)
		(bad cue)
		(enter bar 1)
	(else)
		(no conscious movement)
		(tick)
	(endif)
	(stop)

(perform [take *])
